# Dependencies
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Environment
.env
backend/.env
mock_targets/*/.env

# Database / runtime data (sqlite db + WAL/SHM, pilot-run artifacts).
# CI recreates the directory via `mkdir -p data`, so nothing here is tracked.
backend/data/

# Build
frontend/dist/
backend/*.egg-info/
# Java/Maven build output for mock targets (compiled .class, maven-status, jars).
mock_targets/*/target/

# SQLite databases (recreated at runtime by seed scripts); never commit.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
output/
.runtime-logs/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Tools
.playwright-cli/
.omx/
.worktrees/

# Cursor
# AI coding-assistant configuration — local-only, never published.
# .codex/ and .cursor/ hold agent skill definitions, rules and prompt design.
# They are developer tooling, not part of the released artifact, and they were
# also where the last hard-coded contest identifiers survived. Kept on disk so
# local workflow is unaffected; simply untracked.
.codex/
.cursor/

# Windsurf — local-only Superpowers skills (cloned from obra/superpowers)
# Skills are downloaded per machine; not committed to repo.
.windsurf/skills/

# Competition / submission archives — DO NOT publish
# These folders contain personal contest IDs, submitted reports, demo videos, etc.
# Excluded from the public repository to avoid accidental disclosure.
# Generic pattern — no hard-coded participant ID; also catches suffixed
# variants like "<id>-参赛总文件夹 - 省赛1备份/". No trailing slash: the archive
# also arrives as a single "<id>-参赛总文件夹.zip", which a directory-only
# pattern lets through.
*参赛总文件夹*
docs/内部参考.zip
# 国赛材料整理(2026-06-27):新工作区(给队友写材料) + 省赛旧稿归档 — 同样不发布
# 比赛结束后整体迁入 `_归档_比赛材料/`；旧路径规则保留，防止解压回根目录后误提交。
国赛材料编写/
_归档_省赛旧稿/
_归档_比赛材料/

# Personal / private working notes
docs/private/
*.private.md
*.draft.md
notepad.md

